Variables

SN  // 100 x 2 circular buffer array with 100 X,Y positions for the snake body
SH  // SNAKE HEAD INDEX
ST  // SNAKE TAIL INDEX
DX  // MOVE X DIRECTION
DY  // MOVE Y DIRECTION
FX% // FOOD X POSITION
FY% // FOOD Y POSITION
LV  // LEVEL
DE  // MOVEMENT DELAY
PI  // SOUND PITCH DURATION
SC  // SCORE
HS  // HISCORE
MV  // WALL BRICK TO MOVE NEXT
M2  // 2ND WALL BRICK TO MOVE NEXT
GW  // GROW SNAKE FLAG
IN  // HI SCORE INTERMISSION FLAG

Subroutines by line number

GAME SETUP          10

GAME LOOP          500
READ KEYBOARD     2000
PROCESS MOVE      3000
COLLISION DETECT  6000
RENDER SNAKE      1000

ADD FOOD          1500
PLAY SOUND        4000
RERENDER SNAKE    4300
RENDER MINES      4800
R. MORE MINES     4900
MINE DISTANCE     2500

READ HISCORES     3500
SAVE HI SCORE     5800

LEVEL ANIMATION   4400
HISCORE ANIMATION 4700

TITLE COBRAS      7000
TITLE BYNELBR     7100
TITLE LEVEL       7200
TITLE UP!         7300
TITLE HI SCORE    7400
TITLE GAME        7500
TITLE OVER        7600

END GAME          9000


